{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"roadmap","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Roadmap"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Seven milestones, two decision gates. Dates are deliberately absent: this is built\nby one person with AI assistance, and a date would be fiction."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m0-foundations-done","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M0: Foundations · done"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The workspace, the IR, longhand expansion and normalisation, the ladder and layer\nplan, the CSS writer, golden fixtures, "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> build","source":"kirana build"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m1-feasibility-slice-done","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M1: Feasibility slice · done"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Vite adapter, cross-file resolution, "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" for React, relations, "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"select","source":"select"}},{"type":"text","value":",\nkeyframes, modes and themes, the scales preset, and the first conformance runs\nagainst the StyleX and Tailwind originals."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m2-recipes-and-dynamic-styles-done","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M2: Recipes and dynamic styles · done"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">recipe</span>()","source":"recipe()"}},{"type":"text","value":" with slots, finite and open dynamic values, the private runtime,\nincremental rebuilds and hot updates, "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> migrate stylex","source":"kirana migrate stylex"}},{"type":"text","value":", and the full\ncomponent set built on it, which is what found most of the compiler's bugs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"One thing in this milestone's scope is deliberately not built: a persistent\ncache on disk. The engine is 0.05 s of a 16 s build, so a cache that skips it\nsaves nothing you could measure, and every key it has to get right is a way to\nserve stale CSS."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m4-ecosystem-done-pending-publication","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M4: Ecosystem · done, pending publication"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana installable outside this repository, and proven so on every change. Built\nso far: the packages and the eight per-platform engine packages are packed as\ntarballs, and CI installs them with npm, pnpm, Yarn and Bun on Linux, macOS,\nWindows and Alpine, builds an example and checks it in a browser."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Also built: adapters for Rolldown, webpack (with Next.js on webpack), Rspack\n(with Rsbuild) and Bun, each with an example the same CI builds and checks."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Also built: Preact and Solid, where "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" compiles to "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"class","source":"class"}},{"type":"text","value":", and plain\nTypeScript through class strings."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Also built: Vue, Nuxt, Svelte, SvelteKit and Astro, with "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" in their templates,\nan install guide per framework, and every Vite-based one checked in its dev server\non every change."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Also built: Qwik 2, where "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" compiles to "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"class","source":"class"}},{"type":"text","value":"; and Angular, through an "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-string\">[sx]</span>","source":"[sx]"}},{"type":"text","value":"\ndirective, with builders for the Angular CLI and a Vite plugin for Analog. Each\nhas an example CI builds and checks in a browser and in its dev server."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Also built: a guide and a tested example for every framework Tailwind documents\n(React Router, Gatsby, Ember, Meteor and Parcel), and server templates in Laravel,\nSymfony, Rails, Phoenix and AdonisJS, through a class map and a helper per\ntemplate language."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Also built: the "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"WASI engine"}]},{"type":"text","value":", which runs where no native build does and writes\nthe same bytes; and published libraries, compiled by the apps that list them in\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"libraries","source":"libraries"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Also built: esbuild and Jest; style updates on every development server; Deno as\na runtime; and a check that every bundler compiles the same source to the same\nclasses as Vite."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What remains waits on publishing to npm: installing with Yarn and Deno from the\nregistry."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m5-utility-surface-done","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M5: Utility surface · done"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/styling/utilities","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Utility strings"}]},{"type":"text","value":" in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":", from a grammar a preset\ndeclares as data; "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/preset-scales","source":"@kirana-style/preset-scales"}},{"type":"text","value":" ships Tailwind v4's names, including\ncomposed utilities (rings, shadows, translations, filters) and pseudo-elements.\nA property test compiles all 7,391 utilities the grammar generates and checks\neach gives the same atoms as its object."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> migrate tailwind","source":"kirana migrate tailwind"}},{"type":"text","value":" is built on the same lowering. The exit criterion was\nto migrate the Tailwind original of our shadcn/ui port with it and match the original:\nafter the codemod and 38 hand fixes, conformance finds "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"zero computed-style\ndifferences"}]},{"type":"text","value":" on all 189 routes of the three applications, at three widths, in\nboth colour schemes, at rest and with overlays, menus and other interactive\nstates open. The "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/migration/from-tailwind","children":[{"type":"text","value":"migration guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" has the numbers\nand every pitfall the hand fixes resolved."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The language server's support for utility strings moved to M3."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"m3-developer-experience-done-pending-publication","children":[{"type":"text","value":"M3: Developer experience · done, pending publication"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Editor and lint support, read from the compiler rather than re-implemented, so\nthey never disagree with the build."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built"}]},{"type":"text","value":" (sprint 6):"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"loose":true,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Language server"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/editor","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">kirana</span> lsp","source":"kirana lsp"}}]},{"type":"text","value":": diagnostics at the\nproperty, hover with the compiled CSS and the winning entry's ladder step,\ntoken values in both modes, colour swatches, an inline summary after every\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":", code lenses, completion for conditions, "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"select","source":"select"}},{"type":"text","value":" targets, keyword values\nand utility strings, navigation for tokens and relations, and code actions\n(quick fixes, show compiled CSS, explain precedence, and convert Tailwind classes\nto "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">css</span>()","source":"css()"}},{"type":"text","value":"). Hover answers in 1.2 ms at the 95th percentile on our shadcn/ui port."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"VS Code and Zed extensions"}]},{"type":"text","value":", running the project's own server; Neovim and\nHelix through their own LSP configuration."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/tooling/lint","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin","source":"@kirana-style/eslint-plugin"}}]}]},{"type":"text","value":": nine rules under Oxlint and\nESLint with identical results, each described on the lint page. This repository\nlints itself with them."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built"}]},{"type":"text","value":" (sprint 7):"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Editors in Vue, Svelte and Astro components"}]},{"type":"text","value":", the style card (box model,\nevery declaration, compiled CSS), coloured summaries at the end of each line,\nthe Style Inspector and Style Fold."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"t